    "answer": {
      "short": "$X$ records non-numerical colour categories, which cannot form the numerical intervals required for a histogram. Use a column graph or bar graph instead.",
      "worked": "A histogram groups numerical data into adjacent intervals. The colours recorded by $X$ are categories rather than numerical values, so they cannot form these intervals. Their frequencies can be represented by a column graph or bar graph.",
